                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bowen to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-09-24"><hi rendition="#italic">September 24,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Bowen reports that the United States flag was hoisted and saluted with 21
                    guns by the Venezuelan war ship <hi rendition="#italic">Restaurador.</hi>)</p>
            </div>
